~ start

match GameState.fountain_key_taken
	when false
		PLUM: Dad doesn't let me throw coins in fountains... (sad)
		VINCENT: The key to the door should be in the fountain.

		- Take the key
			$> GameState.give_house_key()
			The house key was added to your items.
			=> END

		- Make Vincent do it
			VINCENT: Are you serious? (surprised)
			VINCENT: Fine... (angry)
			$> GameState.give_house_key()
			Vincent added the house key to your items.
			=> END

	else
		PLUM: The fountain is empty now.
		=> END